antity remains zero.\nBut the test is cheap so that's OK.\n\nThanks to Guillaume Meunier, Head of Vulnerability Operations Center\nFrance at Orange Cyberdefense, for reporting this bug.\n\nThis should be backported to all stable versions.\")\n\nShow description for 7315428 \n\n[ ](/wtarreau) [ wtarreau ](/haproxy/haproxy/commits?author=wtarreau)\n\ncommitted  on Mar 5 \n\n\u00b7 \n\n34 / 34 \n\n[ 7315428  ](/haproxy/haproxy/commit/731542861533ac2cb1d83cfeb366754e48cc7919)\n\nCopy full SHA for 7315428 \n\n[ ](/haproxy/haproxy/blob/731542861533ac2cb1d83cfeb366754e48cc7919/src/hpack-dec.c) [ ](/haproxy/haproxy/tree/731542861533ac2cb1d83cfeb366754e48cc7919)\n\nMore actions \n\n\n\n\n<::before>\n\n###  Commits on Feb 14, 2023 \n\n  * ####  400 Bad request  Your browser sent an invalid request. \n\n\n\n\n$ socat /var/run/haproxy.stat \n",
